From: Alex Perrin <44126061+AlexPerrin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 20:34:02 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Send item examines as ObjExamine game messages

objExamine ran the examine_item clientscript, which prints the text with mes as
a plain game message (type 0). OSRS sends item examines as chat type 27
(ObjExamine), which client plugins such as RuneLite's Examine plugin match on.
Send the examine text (or "N x Name." for stacks of 100,000 or more) as
ObjExamine. The market/alch line the clientscript added is no longer shown.
---
 .../rsmod/api/player/output/GameMessage.kt    | 26 ++++-----
 .../rsmod/api/player/output/ObjExamineTest.kt | 53 +++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 62 insertions(+), 17 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 api/player-output/src/test/kotlin/org/rsmod/api/player/output/ObjExamineTest.kt

diff --git a/api/player-output/src/main/kotlin/org/rsmod/api/player/output/GameMessage.kt b/api/player-output/src/main/kotlin/org/rsmod/api/player/output/GameMessage.kt
